    "answer": {
      "short": "$6607\\text{ g}$.",
      "worked": "The $375\\text{ mL}$ of water has a mass of $375\\text{ g}$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Bag mass}&=(1.2\\times1000)\\text{ g}\\\\\\text{Bag mass}&=1200\\text{ g}\\\\\\text{Laptop mass}&=(3.4\\times1000)\\text{ g}\\\\\\text{Laptop mass}&=3400\\text{ g}\\\\\\text{Filled bottle mass}&=(15+375)\\text{ g}\\\\\\text{Filled bottle mass}&=390\\text{ g}\\\\\\text{Total mass}&=(1200+3400+230+390+55+945+387)\\text{ g}\\\\\\text{Total mass}&=6607\\text{ g}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
